      <p style="text-align: center;"><strong>Distinguishing Feature</strong> – For all zones, the area below the elevated floor is enclosed, either partially or fully. In A Zones, the partially or fully enclosed area below the elevated floor is with or without openings present in the walls of the enclosure. Indicate information about enclosure size and openings in Section A – Property Information.</p>
